        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Atutubet a ŋituŋa a Manase alo To aŋolol Yorodan",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aponi nai tokorakinae ekabila a Manase akwap, anerae arae Manase lokoku a Yosepu ŋolokiyae. Keris sek kekorakin Gilead ka Bacan neni a Makir a ŋolo erae ekiyae a Manase aŋuna araakar iŋes arwonit ŋina ajion. Anyaritae ekiro a papa a Makir Gilead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aponi tokorakinae akwap ŋina alo To Yorodan neni a ŋidwe a Manase a ŋuluce a lu: Abieser, Elek, Asiriel, Sekem, Eper ka Semida. Arae ŋul ŋiletok a Manase a Lokoku a Yosepu ŋulusapa a ŋatekerin kec.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai Selopead Lokoku a Eper a ŋolo arae lokoku a Gilead a ŋolo arae lokoku a Makir a ŋolo arae lokoku a Manase, amamukar iŋes ŋidwe ŋulusapa, arae ŋidwe ŋulupesur bon ayakar iŋes. Ŋirorwa kec ikes lu: Mala, Noa, Ogila, Milika ka Tirisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ikes toloto neni a Eleasar a esacaradoti ka neni a Yosua a lokoku a Nun ta neni a ŋikarikok a Ŋisirael temasi, “Abu Ekapolon kicik Moses akorakin isua akwap ŋina eruwor ŋina kosi lopite ŋolo ekorakinitere ŋikaipapae kosi.” Aŋun, ikwaŋinapei ecikitor Ekapolon Moses, abu Yosua inak ikes aloyeneta a papa kec akwap ŋina abu toruwor ŋina kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋakiro ŋun ikes aryamunia Manase ŋatutubeta ŋace ŋatomon, kimorikinos neni a ŋunaarei a nu: Gilead ka Basan alo Kide Yorodan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyatakina akwap kec, anerae apotu ŋidwe a Manase ŋulupesur toryamut akwap kaapei ka ŋikaipapae kec, nai arae akwap a Gilead ŋina a ŋiletok a Manase a ŋuluce.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esyakinit ekukoru a Manase alo Aser tari Mikimesas neni iteosi ka Sekem. A nen kidir lowae ŋolo alo Kwap, nakwap ŋina a En-Tapua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae akwap a Tapua ŋina a Manase, nai nenilope erae etaun Tapua ŋolo ayai lokukoru a Manase, arae ŋolo a Epuraim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Totiyaar nai ekukoru kec a nen tomyaa lowae ŋolo alo Kwap ayonae Kana. Ŋitaunio ŋulu aya lowae ŋolo alo Kwap ayonae, arae ŋulu a Epuraim tari daŋ ŋina ayakatar ŋitaunio ŋul nakwap a Manase. A nen, kinapakin ekukoru a Manase ayonae alowae a ŋolo alo Kuju, toremokin nanam Mediteranian. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayai akwap a Epuraim Kwap ŋina a Manase toyai ŋina a Manase Kuju ŋina a Epuraim. Arae ekukoru keŋ alowae a ŋolo alo To anam Mediteranian, alo Kuju arae ekukoru keŋ Aser ka alowae a ŋolo alo Kide arae Isakar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayakasi Isakar ka Aser ŋitaunio ŋulu arae ŋulu a Manase; ikes lu: Bes-Can ka ŋirerya keŋ, Ibileam ka ŋirerya keŋ, Dor ka ŋirerya keŋ, En-Dor ka ŋirerya keŋ, Taanak ka ŋirerya keŋ, Megido ka ŋirerya keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa apedorito ŋituŋa a Manase akikamar ŋitaunio ŋul, anerae ariŋa Ŋikanaani imukekinito akiboi anakwap a ŋin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai apaki ŋina agogoŋiorotor Ŋisirael, apotu toreikis Ŋikanaani kituruwosi ŋiketiyak kec, nai apotu nyiritasi ikes jik.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kiŋitakis ŋituŋa ŋulu ke ekabila a Epuraim ka Manase akiyatakino akwap kec.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋituŋa a ekabila a Epuraim ka Manase kiŋita Yosua temasi, “Kaanukiro ikiinakinia iyoŋ isua akwap epei bon tolalakatei bo isua ikwapei adaunia Ekapolon akiterereŋ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toboŋok Yosua ikes tema, “Ani kilalak iyes, toloto namoni kidimut akwap aŋuna kus anakwap a Ŋiperisi ka a Ŋirepaim, anerae edidiŋ aŋuna kus akwap ŋina a ŋikamukumukui ŋina a Epuraim.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimut ŋituŋa a Yosepu temasi, “Edidiŋ aŋuna kosi akwap ŋina a ŋikamukumukui ŋin ka nabo Ŋikanaani daadaŋ ŋulu elomito nadipoe, eyakatar ŋagaari ŋuna a ŋasuwa ŋuna ke ejie; tari ŋulu alo Bes-Can ka ŋirerya keŋ kaapei ka ŋulu anakadipaalat Yesireel ikote nenipei.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai Yosua tolimok ŋituŋa a ekabila a Epuraim ka ŋolo a Manase ŋolo alo To tema, “Ilalak iyes nooi ka igogoŋ nooi. Nyiryamunete iyes akwap apei bon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nai eruwor akwap ŋina a ŋikamukumukui daŋ ŋina kus. Erae akwap ŋin amoni, kidimutu iŋes. Eruwor iŋes daadaŋ ŋina kus. Kire, iritarete iyes Ŋikanaani tari daŋ kegogoŋ nooi ka keyakatar ŋagaari ŋuna a ŋasuwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
